epeg
------------------------------------------
Insanely fast JPEG/ JPG thumbnail scaling with the minimum fuss and CPU
overhead. It makes use of libjpeg features of being able to load an image by
only decoding the DCT coefficients needed to reconstruct an image of the size
desired.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libepeg-devel-0.9.3-1bl2
  libepeg0-0.9.3-1bl2
  libexif12-0.6.26-1
  libjpeg-devel-3.2.0-1
  libjpeg8-3.2.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libexif-devel-0.6.26-1
  libjpeg-devel-3.2.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/mattes/epeg

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/mattes/epeg/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack epeg-0.9.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./epeg-0.9.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/epeg-0.9.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/epeg-0.9.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libepeg0-0.9.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libepeg-devel-0.9.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(epeg)
  /usr/bin/epeg.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/epeg.README
  /usr/share/doc/epeg/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/epeg/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/epeg/COPYING-PLAIN
  /usr/share/doc/epeg/README
  /usr/share/doc/epeg/README.md

(libepeg0)
  /usr/bin/cygepeg-0.dll

(libepeg-devel)
  /usr/include/Epeg.h
  /usr/lib/libepeg.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/epeg.pc

